                        ],
                        "form": "Mercedeses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea02d9be-5972-3acd-aa4c-2dede75f8c7d",
                        "entry_id": "0e9cfef5-1a47-3b6f-8968-409fc49c63df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of Mercedes-Benz (“a car manufactured by Mercedes-Benz”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9242ce21-0941-470b-8228-850315e8bb71",
                                "sense_id": "ea02d9be-5972-3acd-aa4c-2dede75f8c7d",
                                "text": "On a bridge that leads from Nile Street to the café in Tahrir Square where [Naguib] Mahfouz takes his morning coffee, there is often a beggar working his way among cars stuck in the city’s perpetual traffic jam. One of his legs is missing, and he hops up to the windows of the Mercedeses and Fiats on his remaining, bare foot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74eb2ec3-70b9-4f35-bc2e-a0ae0bdde1cf",
                                "sense_id": "ea02d9be-5972-3acd-aa4c-2dede75f8c7d",
                                "text": "Samuel T. blew off the line-up of sheep at the base of Easterly’s hill, shooting his Jag around the Mercedeses, Audis, Porsches, and limos, and waving at the parkers who tried to flag him down so he’d stop."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5828456-3e21-4ebc-8a80-5543599bc925",
                                "sense_id": "ea02d9be-5972-3acd-aa4c-2dede75f8c7d",
                                "text": "Anton and I saw each of them pull up in their Mercedeses and BMWs and park quasi-legally within a convenient distance of the diner."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cf111bd-632d-414d-98d9-bc67fbf8ce98",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e9cfef5-1a47-3b6f-8968-409fc49c63df",
                        "source_sense_id": "ea02d9be-5972-3acd-aa4c-2dede75f8c7d",
                        "source_sense_description": "short form of Mercedes Benz",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mercedes",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mercedes",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee9db86c-8b19-3244-aa29-5143395dd42e",
                                        "entry_id": "f9bf6060-464f-3c82-86e9-fd1d3447af94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7628a39e-36b5-4766-83d4-61be6ced702e",
                                                "sense_id": "ee9db86c-8b19-3244-aa29-5143395dd42e",
                                                "text": "On dit souvent des voix qui nous émeuvent — pour ma part, je pense à Mercedes Sosa et Björk — qu’elles sont inclassables dans une époque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mercedes",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a63fffb2-6ea7-3e3b-8f3d-115eb002da53",
                                        "entry_id": "1637716e-9abf-3b63-852f-f3de8e20c294",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marque de voitures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b317ab58-fa16-3d95-87aa-816bc7b1c386",
                                        "entry_id": "1637716e-9abf-3b63-852f-f3de8e20c294",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Voiture de cette marque, en tant que signe de richesse et, conséquemment, de puissance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "081787cb-6172-4442-bf6e-66fc456d23cd",
                                                "sense_id": "b317ab58-fa16-3d95-87aa-816bc7b1c386",
                                                "text": "Il n'y aurait là ni gourou tout-puissant, ni Mercedes de fonction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7179da58-5848-483c-8d6a-a81ae3d508a7",
                                                "sense_id": "b317ab58-fa16-3d95-87aa-816bc7b1c386",
                                                "text": "Si l’Espagnol en tire profit en s’élançant en tête, le Mexicain est immédiatement débordé par l’Alpine de Fernando Alonso et la Mercedes de Lewis Hamilton."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
